ind":"announcement","title":"FURMAGEDDON is at Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Our first demo is finally here! Gather your friends, choose your hero, and get ready to unleash FURMAGEDDON!Hey, everyone! After several months of hard work, we're finally ready to share the first demo of FURMAGEDDON, available now on Steam as part of Steam Next Fest!This is our team's first time making a roguelite. We love the genre for its fast-paced action, unpredictability, and replayability, and we wanted to bring something of our own to the table: a vibrant visual style, a unique atmospher","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:40:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695093","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4270860-1840310314344508","game_id":"steam-4270860","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Furmageddon!","summary":"Hello everyone! We're excited to finally share what we've been working on! Over the past several years, we've been developing games in the IRON GUARD universe for multiple platforms. Most recently, we released IRON GUARD: Day Zero on PlayStation 5. As much as we love that universe, we felt it was time to try something new. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46225692/f1b481f6531d9d70af98da631ad95c49726508c3.gif Furmageddon is a co-op roguelite that can be played solo or with up to four players. Our goal is to co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T10:04:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4270860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:34Z","error_codes":[]}}